{"id":615,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と六年教育で学びを深める県立附属中学校","feature_description":"諫早高等学校附属中学校は、県立の中高一貫教育のもと、六年間を見通して確かな学力と主体性を育てます。日々の教科学習を土台に、探究や行事で課題に向き合い、仲間と対話しながら考えを深めます。自ら目標を定め、学習と学校生活の両面で努力を積み重ねる経験を通じて、地域と社会の未来を担うための思考力、表現力、協働する力を養います。未来につながる学びを進めます。","clubs":[],"profile_sources":[{"id":3552,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/section/httpwww2news-ed-jpisahaya-h/","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-10","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":3553,"attribute_key":"feature_description","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/section/httpwww2news-ed-jpisahaya-h/","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-10","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null}]}
